# DeleteProfile refused with profileNotInDisabledState(2).
#
# SGP.22 v2.6 section 5.7.18: the eUICC checks the profile's state and
# its Profile Policy Rules first, and returns an error rather than
# deleting an enabled profile. This is the one refusal that matters for
